 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "653008c6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 簡介\n",
    "串列是一個可以儲存多個元素(整數，浮點數，或字串)的容器。\n",
    "串列中每個元素都是使用逗號隔開，左右[]。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "3cd608a9",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "[78, 29, 56, 80, 99]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "scores = [78,29,56,80,99]\n",
    "print(scores)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "89aef295",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 索引直\n",
    "我們可以使用索引直(index)來存取串咧中的元素。\n",
    "注意:索引直由0開始"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "0aac3cb7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "78\n",
      "80\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(scores[0])\n",
    "print(scores[3])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "64d71866",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 串列內容的個數\n",
    "len(a)取的a這個串列中元素的個數\n",
    "len是length(長度)的意思"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "4afad784",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "5\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print(len(scores))"
   ]
  }
 ],
